       The  modifiers below are specific to certain operations. See the Opera‐
       tions section to determine which modifiers are applicable to which  op‐
       erations.

       aa      When inserting or moving member files, this option specifies the
              destination of the new files as being after the  _r_e_l_p_o_s  member.
              If  _r_e_l_p_o_s  is not found, the files are placed at the end of the
              aarrcchhiivvee. _r_e_l_p_o_s cannot be consumed without either _a, _b or _i.

       bb      When inserting or moving member files, this option specifies the
              destination  of the new files as being before the _r_e_l_p_o_s member.
              If _r_e_l_p_o_s is not found, the files are placed at the end  of  the
              aarrcchhiivvee.  _r_e_l_p_o_s  cannot  be  consumed without either _a, _b or _i.
              This modifier is identical to the _i modifier.

       ii      A synonym for the _b option.

       LL      When quick appending an aarrcchhiivvee, instead quick append  its  mem‐
              bers. This is a feature for llllvvmm--aarr that is not found in gnu-ar.

